ss chargers under HS 8504.40 or 8543.70. Request signed HS classification certificates from your factory. Misclassification can result in 5-15% overpaid duty."}]},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":2,"name":"Calculate the 2026 Duty Stack","itemListElement":[{"@type":"HowToDirection","text":"For US imports from China in August 2026: Apply MFN base (0% for chargers, 3.4% for power banks), then add 25% Section 301, then add the 10-12.5% Section 301 forced-labor tariff (tiered by economy; in force since July 24, 2026, when it replaced the expired Section 122 surcharge). EU duty rates remain 0-3.7% MFN plus VAT 19-27%. UK duty 0% plus 20% VAT."}]},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":3,"name":"Add Fixed Customs Fees","itemListElement":[{"@type":"HowToDirection","text":"Add MPF (0.3464% of cargo value, min $32.71 / max $634.62 in 2026), HMF (0.125% on ocean cargo only), ISF filing ($25-50), customs bond ($50 single-entry or $500-600 annual), and customs broker ($150-500 per shipment)."}]},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":4,"name":"Choose Shipping Mode and Incoterm","itemListElement":[{"@type":"HowToDirection","text":"Sea freight LCL/FCL: 25-35 days, lowest cost per unit for bulk. Air freight: 5-10 days, best for mid-volume. Express courier: 3-7 days, best under 100kg. Choose FOB Shenzhen for cost control or DDP for single-price convenience. Power banks require dangerous goods handling."}]},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":5,"name":"Calculate Final Landed Cost Per Unit","itemListElement":[{"@type":"HowToDirection","text":"Total landed cost = product + freight + insurance + duties + customs fees + broker + drayage + 3PL receiving. Divide by unit count for landed cost per unit. Build a 3% currency buffer and a 3% AQL defect amortization into your selling price."}]}],"@id":"https://www.wowohcool.com/blog/import-costs-guide/#howto"}]}</script>
